l_running_at_watch_limit\">,\"options\":[\"returned\",\"threw\",\"never_settled\",\"still_running_at_watch_limit\"]}\n2. measures \"returnedJson\": Atlas calls tierCounts([90,75,76,100]). If tierCounts returns, what value does it return, as JSON?\n   answer: {\"kind\":\"json\",\"value\":<any JSON value>}\n3. measures \"virtualMs\": Atlas calls tierCounts([90,75,76,100]). How long until tierCounts returns or throws, in ms of Atlas's virtual clock?\n   answer: {\"kind\":\"number\",\"value\":<number>,\"tolerancePct\":10,\"unit\":\"ms\"}\n\nTASK\nBet on what this experiment's run will measure:\nexactly one bet per question, using the answer JSON shown for it.\nTo decline, bet {\"kind\":\"declined\",\"reason\":\"unknown: <why>\"}.\n\nReturn only this JSON object:\n{\"bets\": [{\"measures\": \"<field>\", \"answer\": {...}, \"rationale\": \"<one or two sentences>\"}]}"
